<title>FRANCE: Alcatel has no comment on Thomson.</title>
<headline>Alcatel has no comment on Thomson.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom had no immediate comment on a government decision it would sell electronics group Thomson SA to Lagardere Groupe instead of to Alcatel.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Alcatel aimed to turn Thomson in the world's number two defence electronics group and wanted to find an Asian partner to turn Thomson Multimedia back into profit.</p>
</text>
